  "unit": "dom-element",
  "description": "One row per rendered DOM element (script/style/head-like tags and display:none subtrees are prefiltered). Own and subtree text statistics, structure, tag one-hot, landmarks, geometry, id/class hints and hashing, page type, and the same core text statistics for the parent and the previous / next sibling. Normalization is NOT fitted here; ranges are OOD clip bounds.",
